WEBVTT

00:07:58.318 --> 00:08:02.174
It had to be approved
by actually two agencies.

00:08:02.198 --> 00:08:06.059
And one is there to preserve

00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:08.424
the dignity and sanctity of the Mall.

00:08:08.448 --> 00:08:11.157
I blush whenever I show this.

00:08:11.181 --> 00:08:14.976
It is yours to interpret.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.018
But one thing I can say

00:08:17.042 --> 00:08:19.476
is that it's a combination

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.726
of iconoclasm

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.353
and adoration.

00:08:25.377 --> 00:08:28.469
There was also some creative
interpretation involved.

00:08:28.493 --> 00:08:31.393
The Congressional Buildings Act of 1910